{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","神肃诛伐"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Unbroken Retribution"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对累计造成伤害最高的敌人造成高额的真实伤害。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Athalia deals massive true damage to the enemy who has dealt the highest cumulative damage."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动的，阿塔利娅拥有强大的意志，在被击败后会化身为圣辉骑枪继续留在战场上攻击敌人，但攻击力会降低35%。\n主动释放时，阿塔利娅跳跃到空中，随后对累计造成伤害最高的敌人降下天罚，对目标造成150% + 27% ATK的真实伤害，附加等同于所有敌人累积损失的生命值30% + 3%的真实伤害，该附加伤害最多不超过自身1500% + 150% ATK，并使其倒地0.5秒，期间自身处于无敌状态。随后，清空本技能对所有敌人累积损失的生命值的计数。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Passive. When Athalia is defeated, her unyielding resolve manifests as a lance that continues to attack enemies on the battlefield, with her ATK reduced by 35%.\nActive. Athalia leaps into the air and strikes the enemy with the highest cumulative damage dealt, dealing 150% + 27% ATK true damage plus extra true damage equal to 30% + 3% of all enemies' total HP lost she has recorded. The extra true damage cannot exceed 1500% + 150% ATK. Enemies hit are knocked down for 0.5s, and Athalia remains invincible while casting this skill. After using this skill, she resets her record of enemies' HP loss to zero."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":97,"end":103,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":133,"end":138,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":161,"end":168,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":272,"end":278,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":330,"end":335,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":425,"end":432,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":93,"end":107,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":156,"end":172,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":189,"end":191,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":268,"end":282,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":420,"end":436,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":497,"end":507,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，对目标造成的真实伤害提升至180% + 27% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the true damage dealt to 180% + 27% ATK when this skill is used actively."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":39,"end":45,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":35,"end":49,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，对目标造成的真实伤害提升至210% + 27% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases the true damage dealt to 210% + 27% ATK when this skill is used actively."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":39,"end":45,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":35,"end":49,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，对目标造成的真实伤害提升至240% + 27% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the true damage dealt to 240% + 27% ATK when this skill is used actively."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":39,"end":45,"