+ 40% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":48,"end":54,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":44,"end":58,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","锐意之风"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/en","Vanguard's Renewal"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","对周围1格范围的敌人造成伤害，并回复少量生命值。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/en","Athalia deals damage to adjacent enemies and recovers a small amount of HP."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","阿塔利娅化身圣辉骑枪，对周围1格范围内的敌人造成6次20% + 3% ATK伤害，施法期间自身处于霸体状态，受到的伤害降低60% + 2%，并回复150% + 15% ATK的生命值。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Athalia transforms into a lance, striking adjacent enemies 6 times, with each hit dealing 20% + 3% ATK damage. While casting this skill, Athalia becomes unaffected, reduces damage taken by 60% + 2%, and recovers 150% + 15% ATK HP."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":29,"end":34,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":64,"end":69,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":77,"end":83,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":93,"end":98,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":192,"end":197,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":216,"end":222,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":49,"end":51,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":73,"end":87,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":90,"end":102,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"star