"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/en","Hero Focus"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身暴击。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/en","Increases Crit during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的暴击提升12点，对累计造成伤害最高的敌人造成伤害时暴击额外提升30点。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Increases Crit by 12 during battle. When dealing damage to the enemy with the highest cumulative damage dealt, Crit is further increased by 30."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的暴击提升16点，对累计造成伤害最高的敌人造成伤害时暴击额外提升40点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases Crit by 16 during battle. When dealing damage to the enemy with the highest cumulative damage dealt, Crit is further increased by 40."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的暴击提升20点，对累计造成伤害最高的敌人造成伤害时暴击额外提升50点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases Crit by 20 during battle. When dealing damage to the enemy with the highest cumulative damage dealt, Crit is further increased by 50."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","圣诫裁决"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Divine Verdict"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","多次释放“执罚迅锋”时能够追加斩击次数造成额外伤害。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","Continuously using Vengeance Charge triggers Athalia to cast Sacred Slash, dealing extra damage."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每第二次释放“执罚迅锋”时，会额外对战场上两条敌人数量最多的直线路径进行“神圣斩击”，对路径上的敌人造成200% ATK伤害，优先选择与本次“执罚迅锋”冲刺路径不同的直线路径。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Every second use of Vengeance Charge, Athalia's dash simultaneously unleashes Sacred Slashes, striking the two straight paths with the most enemies. Each slash deals 200% ATK damage to all enemies in its paths. These slashes prioritize straight paths that do not overlap with the dash path of the Vengeance Charge that triggers them."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":30,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"keyword:standardline"},{"start":52,"end":60,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":83,"end":87,"tooltip_key":"keyword:standardline"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":111,"end":125,"tooltip_key":"keyword:standardline"},{"start":166,"end":174,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":236,"end":250,"tooltip_key":"keyword:standardline"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至240% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the impact damage to 240% ATK."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":31,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至280% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases the impact damage to 280% ATK."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":31,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“执罚迅锋”期间阿塔利娅额外提升50点终结，且参与击败敌人或者释放终极技能后，立刻重置“执罚迅锋”的冷却时间。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","While casting Vengeance Charge, Athalia increases her Execution by 50. Whenever she assists or defeats an enemy or uses her Ultimate, the cooldown of Vengeance Charge resets immediately."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"keyword:takedown"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":84,"end":102,"tooltip_key":"keyword:takedown"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","降低敌人护盾的抵御值。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","Reduces the target enemy's shield value."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“执罚迅锋”和“神圣斩击”还会击碎目标身上的护盾，击碎护盾的抵御值至多为自身800% ATK。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Vengeance Charge and Sacred Slash can reduce the target's shield value, up to 800% ATK."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":40,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":78,"end":86,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","圣辉骑枪"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Glory Lance"]]}